<title>GERMANY: Buba's Tietmeyer says 2-yr orientations help ECB.</title>
<headline>Buba's Tietmeyer says 2-yr orientations help ECB.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank president Hans Tietmeyer on Thursday said that two-year orientations, such as that given by it earlier in reference to money supply growth, would help the future European Central Bank</p>
<p>Tietmeyer told a news conference such orientations would help the ECB start as smoothly as possible.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
